        <body>
            <div xml:id="d659">

                <pb facs="0647" n="573" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg573"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Tassara to Mr.
                        Hunter</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Spain to the United
                                States</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">New York,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-06-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 2, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, minister plenipotentiary of her Catholic Majesty, has received
                    at New York, where he is for the time being, the note which, on the 30th May,
                    the honorable Acting Secretary of State pleased to address to him, claiming the
                    Stonewall, whose rendition, in effect, has been officially communicated to him
                    by the captain general of Cuba, and will transmit said note to his government,
                    that it may determine on the affair.</p>
                <p>The undersigned offers on the occasion to the honorable Acting Secretary of State
                    reiterated assurances of his highest consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GABRIEL G. TASSARA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Hunter</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting Secretary of State, &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.,</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
